Patricia: Patricia (UCI chess engine)
Patricia:
Patricia: Patricia is a UCI chess engine which means it needs a UCI-compatible
Patricia: front-end to play, such as XBoard, LucasChess, or CuteChess. Patricia
Patricia: uses a pair of NNEU neural networks for evaluation, one of them was
Patricia: trained with specially selected "aggressive positions". Patricia can
Patricia: be tuned to play at lower skill levels, from ELO 500 to 3000.
